{"path":"/services/wordpress-to-webflow-migration/","slug":"services__wordpress-to-webflow-migration","kind":"service","title":"Managed Trade | Licensed Customs Operations | KlearNow","description":"When you would rather hand customs off to licensed experts, KlearNow runs clearance, compliance, and filing on the same platform your data already lives in.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Services</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>WordPress to Webflow Migration Agency</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A WordPress to Webflow migration rebuilds your site for visual editing and managed hosting. We map content and URLs, review plugin replacements, test the new site and track search performance through launch. Your team rehearses its publishing tasks before handover.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"page-brief\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div class=\"container page-brief__inner\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div data-astro-cid-onysphra><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Migration planning</span><h2 data-astro-cid-onysphra>How do you migrate from WordPress to Webflow safely?</h2></div><div class=\"page-brief__body\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><p data-astro-cid-onysphra>Start with a URL and content inventory, preserve useful URLs and metadata, map changed addresses to relevant destinations, and test redirects, forms and analytics before launch. Keep a recoverable copy of the old site. After cutover, check indexing, traffic and enquiries against the dated baseline.</p><ul data-astro-cid-onysphra><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/blog/how-to-migrate-from-wordpress-to-webflow-without-losing-seo/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Read the migration checklist<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/blog/how-long-does-a-wordpress-to-webflow-migration-take/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Plan the migration timeline<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Migrated Properly</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>What Moving Off WordPress Gives Marketing</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The campaign page waits on a PHP developer</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Custom PHP and a tangle of plugins mean every real change waits on the one developer who understands how the site was built. The campaign window closes while the request sits in the queue.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A plugin update takes the site down on launch day</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every feature is another third-party plugin, and every update is a chance something else breaks. The site needs constant patching to stay safe, and someone has to own that cycle for as long as it runs.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M16 12H17.4C17.7314 12 18 12.2686 18 12.6V19.4C18 19.7314 17.7314 20 17.4 20H6.6C6.26863 20 6 19.7314 6 19.4V12.6C6 12.2686 6.26863 12 6.6 12H8M16 12V8C16 6.66667 15.2 4 12 4C8.8 4 8 6.66667 8 8V12M16 12H8\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The move itself is the risk nobody prices</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Most migration damage is self-inflicted: URLs bulk-redirected to the home page, a thousand words cut to fit a tidier template, schema left behind. The rankings fall two months later, and by then the old site is gone.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The rankings you earned come with you</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every URL with traffic, backlinks or conversions is inventoried before anything is designed, mapped one to one, and monitored through cutover. When K2 Group retired a legacy domain, all 261 stranded URLs were mapped to new homes.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Your team publishes without a developer</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The plugin stack is replaced by native Webflow features and a governed component library. A new landing page or case study assembles from parts that already match, on marketing’s calendar.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The patching liability ends at cutover</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Hosting, CDN, SSL and security updates become Webflow’s job. The plugin cycle ends, and with it the risk that one missed update makes the site a target.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What Stays Measurable</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What You Can Still Prove After the Move</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Rankings tracked through the switch</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The old site stays live until the new one is proven, and rankings are tracked through the switch rather than checked after the fact. If a page moves, you know which one and why.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5 12V18C5 18 5 21 12 21C19 21 19 18 19 18V12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M5 6V12C5 12 5 15 12 15C19 15 19 12 19 12V6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M12 3C19 3 19 6 19 6C19 6 19 9 12 9C5 9 5 6 5 6C5 6 5 3 12 3Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Before-and-after comparisons that hold</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Goals, events and historical data carry over, so the first report after launch compares like with like instead of starting from a blank dashboard. The question of whether the migration hurt gets a numbered answer.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M10 12H5C4.44772 12 4 11.5523 4 11V7.5C4 6.94772 4.44772 6.5 5 6.5H9C9.55228 6.5 10 6.94772 10 7.5V12ZM10 12C10 14.5 9 16 6 17.5\"/><path d=\"M20 12H15C14.4477 12 14 11.5523 14 11V7.5C14 6.94772 14.4477 6.5 15 6.5H19C19.5523 6.5 20 6.94772 20 7.5V12ZM20 12C20 14.5 19 16 16 17.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>AI citations counted from launch day</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The same monthly citation checks we run for every client start the day the new site goes live, so visibility in AI answers is measured from the first month rather than assumed.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" id=\"migration-content\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Content and functionality</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>What moves from WordPress to Webflow?</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>The move from WordPress to Webflow includes content, templates and integrations. A content import transfers records; the website design and behaviour still need to be built and checked.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Posts, pages and media</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Map fields to Webflow CMS collections, import a sample and check images, references and slugs. Confirm the plan's collection limits before the full import. <a href=\"https://help.webflow.com/hc/en-us/articles/33961193662739-Migrate-your-site-from-WordPress-to-Webflow\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Webflow's migration guide</a> explains the XML-to-CSV content route.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Templates and plugin behaviour</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Rebuild layouts as reusable components. Review forms, search, localisation and other plugin-dependent features separately, with a named replacement or an agreed reason to retain the current setup.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>URLs and launch checks</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Keep useful URLs where possible, redirect changed paths and check links, metadata, forms and analytics. Retain a recoverable copy of the old site and agree who can approve the cutover.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"page-brief\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div class=\"container page-brief__inner\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><div data-astro-cid-onysphra><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Choosing the direction</span><h2 data-astro-cid-onysphra>Considering a Webflow to WordPress migration?</h2></div><div class=\"page-brief__body\" data-astro-cid-onysphra><p data-astro-cid-onysphra>The right direction depends on your requirements. WordPress may suit a site that depends on its plugin ecosystem or needs direct control of hosting and server code. Moving from Webflow to WordPress still needs a content model, redirect map, form and integration tests, and an agreed owner for maintenance. We assess platform fit before recommending a migration.</p><ul data-astro-cid-onysphra><li data-astro-cid-onysphra><a href=\"/blog/webflow-vs-wordpress-for-b2b-marketing-teams/\" data-astro-cid-onysphra>Compare Webflow and WordPress<span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-onysphra> ↗</span></a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>The Only Real Risk</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>A Migration Can Lose You Traffic You Spent Years Earning</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>The design is the easy half. What decides whether a migration is a success six months later is whether the search equity came across, and that is a mapping problem rather than a design one.</p></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><ol class=\"dp__steps\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>01</span><div data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Inventory before anything is designed</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Every URL with impressions, clicks, backlinks or conversions, pulled from Search Console and a full crawl. This is the document the whole migration is judged against, and it has to exist before the new site has a shape.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>02</span><div data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>A one-to-one redirect map</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Every old URL points at its closest equivalent. Bulk-redirecting to the home page is the standard shortcut, and it discards most of the equity the redirect was there to keep. Where no equivalent exists, that is a decision recorded rather than a 404 discovered later.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>03</span><div data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Carry the words that earned the ranking</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>A page that ranks does so because of what it says. Cutting a thousand words to fit a tidier template is the most common self-inflicted loss in a migration, and it is invisible until the rankings move.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>04</span><div data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Metadata, schema and canonicals move too</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Titles, descriptions, structured data and canonical tags are part of what the old site earned. Rebuilding the page and leaving them behind is a rebuild that starts from zero on purpose.</p></div></li><li class=\"dp__step\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><span class=\"dp__num\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>05</span><div data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Watch it weekly for ninety days</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Crawl weekly against the pre-launch inventory and fix what moved. Most migration damage is cheap to reverse in the first month and expensive once a quarter has passed.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Straight Answers</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>The Trade You Are Making</h2></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>What gets better</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>Marketing can publish without a developer. There is no plugin stack to patch and no plugin conflict to debug. Hosting, CDN and SSL stop being your problem. Most teams find the speed improvement arrives for free, because the thing that was slow was usually the plugins.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy><h3 data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>What you give up</h3><p data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy>The plugin ecosystem, which is the thing WordPress does best. If your site depends on a specific plugin doing something unusual, that has to be solved before a migration is agreed rather than discovered halfway through. We will tell you if it is a reason not to move.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/k2-group.svg\" alt=\"K2 Group\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>All 261 stranded URLs mapped across a six-site estate.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>When K2 Group retired a legacy domain, we mapped its 261 stranded URLs to new homes across their six-site estate, and technical health rose on all five sites measured in the month that followed.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/k2-group/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/covers/case-k2-group.jpg\" alt=\"A harbour at night with moored boats, rendered as a blue pixel dither, captioned Six sites, one answer\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With the Inventory</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out What You Would Be Risking</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A migration is judged on whether the search equity survived it. A call about what your current site earns, what moving would involve, and whether it is worth doing at all right now.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How every earning URL gets inventoried before anything is designed</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A one-to-one redirect map, delivered as a document you keep</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Weekly crawls for ninety days after launch, against the pre-launch baseline</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/services/webflow-enterprise/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How we build on Webflow</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How long does a WordPress to Webflow migration take?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It depends on how many pages, templates and plugins are involved, so every migration starts with a full audit that scopes the work and sets the timeline before anything moves. If you have a launch date, say so on the first call: the URL inventory and the redirect map are the long poles, and they start before design does.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Will we lose our search rankings during the move?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Rankings can fluctuate during a migration. We preserve useful URLs and content, redirect changed addresses to relevant pages, and test metadata, indexing and analytics before launch. A dated baseline and post-launch checks help identify problems; they cannot guarantee unchanged rankings.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can Webflow replace everything our WordPress plugins do?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Most plugin functionality maps to a native Webflow feature or a component we build once. The exceptions get scoped honestly during the audit, and if one of them is a reason to stay on WordPress, you hear that before a migration is agreed.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What happens to our blog content and images?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Every post, page and asset is audited and carried across as part of the migration. Nothing is left behind without a deliberate decision to leave it, and the words that earned each ranking travel with the page.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can you convert a WordPress site to Webflow?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. Converting WordPress to Webflow means rebuilding the templates as Webflow components, moving every post, page and asset across, and mapping each old URL to its new home. The plugin stack is replaced by native Webflow features or by components we build once, and your marketing team publishes on the result without a developer.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-5\" id=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you migrate WordPress to Webflow without losing SEO?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Start with the pages that earn traffic, backlinks and enquiries. Preserve their useful content and URLs, map changed addresses, carry over metadata and test the new site before launch. Monitor indexing and search performance after cutover. These checks reduce avoidable migration risks; search performance can still change.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".page-brief[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{background:var(--white,#fff);border-block:1px solid #0c0c141f;padding-block:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.page-brief__inner[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,5rem);display:grid}h2[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{max-width:20ch;margin-top:.75rem;font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.15}p[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{max-width:65ch;margin:0;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.4vw,1.125rem);line-height:1.65}ul[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem 1.5rem;margin:1.25rem 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:flex}a[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{color:var(--blue);text-underline-offset:.2em;padding-block:.5rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline;display:inline-block}a[data-astro-cid-onysphra]:focus-visible{outline-offset:4px;outline:2px solid}@media (width<=760px){.page-brief__inner[data-astro-cid-onysphra]{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.dp__grid[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy]{gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid}.dp__heading[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy]{font-size:var(--h4);margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);max-width:24ch}.dp__text[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy] p[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy],.dp__sub[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__note[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy]{opacity:.7}.dp__head[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy]{margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);max-width:64ch}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy]{background:var(--white)}.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy]{gap:var(--sp-3);grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));display:grid}.dp__cards--three[data-astro-cid-t5ifmcvy]{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.dp__card[data-astro-